        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-18T20:52:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's pretty much a foregone conclusion that you'll beat her, so I don't really feel up to going and getting the decks to find out what the last Environment play will be, since even if it was a T-Rex it wouldn't be able to influence the outcome significantly.</p><p>(The line where Matty claims that she's controlling the dinosaurs is unfortunately pure megalomania on her part.&nbsp; It'd definitely make an interesting alternate scenario to try sometime though.&nbsp; Lots of ideas as to how to make this match work better in future.)</p>",
